---
title: "The life of one Autoplay run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Before
    lg1: Holds the Game
    lg2: Let go
    lg3: Ended
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 teal
  s0: Not started
  state "Holds the Game" as s1 {
    s2: At its accept
    s3: Its Job runs
    s4: Ends
  }
  s5: Lets go: its accept failed
  s6: Stopped: waits to reach its accept
  s7: Ended: its accept failed
  s8: Lets go: stopped
  s9: Stopped: its Job runs on, cut off
  s10: Ended: stopped
  s11: Lets go: its Job failed
  s12: Ended: its Job failed
  s13: Lets go: its budget is spent
  s14: Ended: its budget is spent
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s2: you start Autoplay
  s2 --> s5: the story cannot be read
  s2 --> s6: you press Stop
  s2 --> s3: the next Job starts or a cycle is counted, the next Job starts
  s5 --> s7: the run ends
  s6 --> s8: the accept finds no holder of the run
  s3 --> s9: you press Stop
  s8 --> s10: the run ends
  s9 --> s8: its Job was cut off
  s3 --> s4: its Job fails
  s9 --> s11: its Job fails
  s4 --> s11: you press Stop
  s4 --> s12: the run ends
  s11 --> s12: the run ends
  s3 --> s2: its Job ends
  s9 --> s6: its Job ends
  s2 --> s13: the budget is spent
  s13 --> s14: the run ends
  class s0 tan
  class s2 blue
  class s3 blue
  class s4 blue
  class s5 orange
  class s6 orange
  class s7 teal
  class s8 orange
  class s9 orange
  class s10 teal
  class s11 orange
  class s12 teal
  class s13 orange
  class s14 teal
